<title>USA: USDA, Angola sign second PL-480 pact for FY 1996.</title>
<headline>USDA, Angola sign second PL-480 pact for FY 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday that Angola had signed a second PL-480 agreement. The new agreement would provide $5 million for purchase of U.S. wheat and shipping costs.</p>
<p>Sale of about 17,000 tonnes of wheat would be facilitated by the agreement. Supply period was set for fiscal 1996, which ends September 30.</p>
</text>
